  {
   "name": "Safety Equipment Distribution",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "A core recurring activity is the procurement and distribution of bicycle lights and helmets to the public. The commission has authorized several large purchases of light kits, often supported by local bank sponsorships, for distribution at schools and community festivals. While a long-standing helmet donation program was discontinued in 2025, a working group was formed to research new municipal procurement methods and corporate sponsors. By late 2026, the commission approved a budget to purchase nearly 1,000 new lights to continue its outreach mission.",
