  {
   "name": "Bluebikes Expansion",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The commission has actively supported the expansion of the regional Bluebikes bike-share system within Medford. Members initially provided feedback on draft station locations and later voted to support grant applications to close service gaps between Medford Square and transit hubs. The network grew from three operational stations in late 2022 to seventeen stations by 2026. The body also monitors usage data and coordinates with city staff to identify viable station locations in West Medford and Logan Park.",
