   "summary": "The commission tracks the development of major multi-use paths, most notably the Clippership Connector and the Mystic River Pedestrian Bridge. Members reviewed designs for the Connector, noting construction delays that pushed its opening to 2025, and advocated for wayfinding signage through Medford Square. The body also supported a bicycle pump track proposal for Carr Park and monitored shared-use path connections under Route 28. Regional connectivity remains a priority, including links to the Northern Strand and the Minuteman path extension.",
